    "stem": "下列 Python 程式計算二項分佈機率，執行後輸出為何？",
    "code": "from math import comb\n\nn, p = 3, 0.2\nprob = comb(n, 1) * p * (1 - p) ** 2\nprint(round(prob, 3))",
    "codeLanguage": "python",
    "verification": {
      "kind": "python-stdout",
      "expectedStdout": "0.384",
      "status": "verified",
