      "D"
    ],
    "explanation": {
      "summary": "二項機率 P(X=k) = C(n,k) pᵏ (1−p)ⁿ⁻ᵏ。",
      "correctRationale": "n=3、p=0.2、k=1：3 × 0.2 × 0.8² = 3 × 0.2 × 0.64 = 0.384。",
      "optionRationales": {
